    tests(resource-safety-smoke): stage the Founder reporting policy
    
    The final integration step runs government/sitting.sh with adequate headroom and
    expects exit 0. sitting.sh requires government/AGENT-REPORTING-POLICY.md and
    exits 1 without it, so the fixture failed on a missing dependency, not on
    resource-safety logic. Staged the policy; assertions unchanged.
    
    Same root cause as the eight earlier fixture repairs.

